  m_text: 'Provide bright, indirect light for at least 6 hours a day and use a well-draining
    soil mix with a pot that has drainage holes. Water them thoroughly but infrequently,
    allowing the soil to dry out completely between waterings to prevent root rot.
    Fertilize sparingly during the spring and summer growing seasons. '
